    "description": "A large 1920's shared residence located in the Mission District near the Zuckerberg Hospital.\n1236 Utah St, San Francisco, CA 94110\n1495.00 / Month\n4 BEDROOMS | 2.5 BATHROOMS\nInterested? Fill out this form\n:\nhttps://renter.turbotenant.com/general-prescreener/T3duZXI6MzI2ODQw?property=2865091&source=cl\nHave questions? Contact the Landlord\n:\nhttps://rental.turbotenant.com/p/1236-utah-st-san-francisco-ca/5f464eee-608b-400d-a394-e717c17480ff?source=craigslist\nProperty Description:\nOne room for rent in a shared house \n\nA large 1920's residence located in the Mission District near the Zuckerberg Hospital. Located on Utah Street between 23 and 24th near grocery markets, taquerias, etc.\n\nUpstairs features 4 bedrooms and 2.5 shared bathrooms, large Kitchen is remodeled and includes oven, stove, dishwasher, and fridge. One Bedroom available for rent has a closet and a window facing the backyard, where there are orange and plum trees and lots of opportunity for gardening or just hanging out. Currently there are three tenants upstairs  so it\u2019s a shared space.\n\nIt includes a indoor laundry with washer/dryer (not coin operated).\n\nNearest bus stops are 9, 10, 33, 48 and it's a 15-20 minute walk to Mission Bart.\n\nRent is $1295/month room pls utikities\nUtilities Approx.  $125/month \nDeposit $1295\nMinimum credit score of 680\nIncome 2x monthly rent\nNo pets\nNo smoking \nGood Background and credit check \nGood Landlord references\nPre-screen required\nProperty Type\n: Single Family\nPets\n: No Pets Allowed\nSmoking\n: NO\nLease Term\n:\n1495.00 / Month\n1495.00 Deposit\nLease Length: Six Months\nAvailable: 10/15/2026\nOccupancy Limit: 7 People\nUtilities Included\n:\nAppliances\n:\nDishwasher\nRange Oven\nGarbage Disposal\nMicrowave\nRefrigerator\nFreezer\nDryer\nWasher\nAmenities\n:\nFenced Yard\nOn Site Laundry\nHeating & Cooling\n:\nForced Air\nNone\nInterested?\nFill out this form\n:\nhttps://renter.turbotenant.com/general-prescreener/T3duZXI6MzI2ODQw?property=2865091&source=cl\nHave questions? Contact the Landlord\n:\nhttps://rental.turbotenant.com/p/1236-utah-st-san-francisco-ca/5f464eee-608b-400d-a394-e717c17480ff?source=craigslist",
